scription to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"packages/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":73,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实现了一个 Marked Markdown 扩展，新增自定义语法 `<![...]>`，将多张图片解析并渲染为适配微信公众号的横向滑动图片 HTML 区块。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-9621b2d99baf4504b3949984716502f9","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"声明描述的是一组名为 skills/baoyu-* 的内容生成与处理子技能列表，但本代码实际是 packages/baoyu-md 中的一个 Markdown 扩展，实现 [TOC] 语法并生成嵌套目录 HTML。它不对应声明中的任何具体子技能名称，且主要功能不是图片生成、网页抓取、发布社交媒体、翻译或 URL 转 Markdown 等。因此该代码块的实际行为与声明用途不一致，属于未被描述覆盖的功能。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"packages/baoyu-md/src/extensions/toc.ts","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":74,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实现了一个 marked 的 Markdown 扩展，为 Markdown 中的 [TOC] 标记生成基于标题的嵌套 HTML 目录导航。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-6b043a91dbcf47c1b00b12d1abcaa197","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The declared description presents a broad skill collection centered on content generation, media processing, posting to platforms, translation, and markdown conversion subskills. The actual code shown is specifically a test suite for markdown rendering behavior, checking that inline code inside emphasis/bold is converted correctly to HTML. That is a materially different purpose from the listed subskills and does not correspond clearly to any named baoyu-* skill in the declaration. While markdown-related functionality exists in the declared list (format markdown, markdown to HTML, URL to markdown), this code is not presented as one of those skills and is instead an internal renderer test from a different package path. Therefore, the code chunk does not accurately match the declared skill description.","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"packages/baoyu-md/src/renderer.test.ts","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":64,"actual_behavior_summary":"The provided code chunk is a TypeScript test file for a Markdown renderer, validating HTML output for inline code, bold, and emphasis edge cases involving backticks and underscores."},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-410a80b10c2f4afbb172ce20dee580f3","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.99,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The declared description describes a collection of content-generation and publishing skills (images, markdown conversion, posting to social platforms, translation, slides, scraping). The supplied code does none of those things. Instead, it is build/release infrastructure test code verifying packaging behavior and local dependency constraints. This is a materially different primary purpose and an unrelated capability set, so the description does not accurately represent the code chunk.","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snipp