"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-4539fc99b0284741beac5b160643ac5f","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The declared description presents this package as a collection of end-user content-generation and processing skills. However, the supplied code chunk does not implement any of those listed subskill behaviors. Instead, it serves as an operational/admin wrapper for syncing the `skills` directory by invoking another Node.js script. That synchronization capability is not declared in the description, and its primary purpose is materially different from the advertised user-facing functions. While it may support distribution of the skills, it is still an undeclared administrative capability rather than one of the described content tools.","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/sync-clawhub.sh","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":16,"actual_behavior_summary":"The provided code is a shell wrapper that checks for Node.js and then executes a separate synchronization script (`scripts/sync-clawhub.mjs`) against the `skills` directory, defaulting to `--all` when no arguments are supplied."},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-e0c0a1ca09ff4e50927fdb7314ce175a","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"声明中的“Gemini网页抓取”通常意味着抓取网页内容，但这段代码没有实现通用网页抓取、页面提取或将 URL 转换为内容的逻辑。相反，它解析 CLI 参数后初始化 GeminiClient，与 Gemini Web 服务交互，支持登录刷新 cookie、发送 prompt、附带参考图片、生成文本或图片、保存图片，以及把会话元数据和消息保存到本地 JSON 文件并可列出会话。其核心行为更接近“Gemini Web 非官方客户端/自动化聊天工具”，而不是“网页抓取”技能。因此描述与实际行为存在实质性不符。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/scripts/main.ts","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":513,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实现的是一个 Gemini Web 命令行客户端：可登录/刷新 Gemini Web cookie、复用或指定 Chrome 配置目录、向 Gemini 发送文本与参考图片、多轮会话持久化到本地文件、列出历史会话、可请求生成图片并保存到本地，还支持 JSON 输出。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"RA1","finding_id":"finding-2791adfe7e214082bb5b98fb2f03c6ba","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Self-Modification","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.85,"location":{"file":"docs/comic-style-maintenance.md","start_line":6,"end_line":null},"finding":"Update SKILL","explanation":"Skill modifies its own code, configuration, or behavior at runtime. Self-modification enables an agent to escalate privileges, disable safety constraints, or install persistent backdoors.","remediation":"Prevent the skill from modifying its own code, SKILL.md, or configuration files. Treat skill files as read-only at runtime.","code_snippet":"## Adding a New Style\n\n1. Create style definition: `skills/baoyu-comic/references/styles/<style-name>.md`\n2. Update SKILL.md: add to `--style` options table + auto-selection entry\n3. Generate showcase image:\n   ```bash\n   ${BUN_X} skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/scripts/main.ts \\","intent":null,"tags":["Rogue Agent"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"7998d0e4ecc4a807bbc60abf0c076946e892f0d093c4d8396ff5d09f46c87275","occurrences":[{"file":"docs/comic-style-maintenance.md","start_line":6,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SC4","finding_id":"finding-64411587102f41a4b20a0e1dcb2a5b9f","category":"Supply Chain","pattern":"Known Vulnerable Dependency: js-yaml==3.14.2 — 4 advisory(ies): CVE-2026-84375 (js-yaml: maxTotalMergeKeys does not limit CPU use for empty merge sources); CVE-2026-59869 (js-yaml: YAML merge-key chains can force quadratic CPU consumption); GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj (JS-YAML: Quadratic CPU consumption in !!omap resolution (3.x and 4.x) — CVE-2026) +1 more","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"package-lock.json","start_line":954,"end_line":null},"finding":"js-yaml==3.14.2","explanation":"Dependency has known vulnerabilities (CVEs). Using packages with unpatched security flaws exposes the environment to known exploits.","remediation":"Update the dependency to a patched version that addresses the known CVE. Check OSV (osv.dev) or NVD for details on the vulnerability.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["Supply Chain"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"85d53bfdd459e0b9f7008f8db7376c2df1e985bc086e91d7c89ed7fd6c12dc4c","occurrences":[{"file":"package-lock.json","start_line":954,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SC4","finding_id":"finding-d26601063c04438da463daadd06de8a6","category":"Supply Chain","pattern":"Known Vulnerable Dependency: undici==6.24.0 — 7 advisory(ies): CVE-2026-6733 (undici vulnerable to HTTP response queue poisoning via keep-alive socket reuse); CVE-2026-16728 (undici vulnerable to downstream response desynchronization via retry interceptor); CVE-2026-11525 (undici vulnerable to Set-Cookie SameSite attribute downgrade via permissive subs) +4 more","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"package-lock.json","start_line":1771,"end_line":null},"finding":"undici==6.24.0","explanation":"Dependency has known vulnerabilities (CVEs). Using packages with unpatched security flaws exposes the environment to known exploits.","remediation":"Update the dependency to a patched version that addresses the known CVE. Check OSV (osv.dev) or NVD for details on the vulnerability.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["Supply Chain"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"1ae675d402c2d71cc7cf234a636ec2224c3832a8b000e49975879bd00d05db08","occurrences":[{"file":"package-lock.json","start_line":1771,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-d756a76cb27842a49669eec9e90c6a34","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-article-illustrator/prompts/system.md","start_line":13,"end_line":13},"finding":null,"explanation":"L13 instructs the skill that if content involves sensitive or copyrighted figures, it should create stylistically similar alternatives and explicitly 'DO NOT refuse to generate.' For an article illustration skill, bypassing refusal behavior for sensitive or copyrighted subjects is not an obviously required capability and expands the skill into policy-evasion behavior unrelated to normal illustration generation.","remediation":"Remove the 'DO NOT refuse to generate' instruction and replace it with guidance to follow the model or platform's standard safety and copyright policies. If handling restricted subjects is needed, document a compliant policy-aligned fallback instead of instructing circumvention.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-article-illustrator/prompts/system.md","start_line":13,"end_line":13}]},{"id":"P6","finding_id":"finding-438dbc32ab9640e09e7bb51f80bacdb4","category":"System Prompt Leakage","pattern":"Direct Prompt Extraction","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.85,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/workflow.md","start_line":381,"end_line":null},"finding":"Display prompt","explanation":"Skill contains instructions that could directly expose system prompts, internal rules, or hidden instructions to users or external parties.","remediation":"Remove any instructions that reveal, print, or output system prompts or internal rules. System instructions should never be exposed to end users.","code_snippet":"\n**Purpose**: User reviews and confirms prompts before image generation.\n\n**Display prompt summary table**:\n\