 targets a real Weibo account, may reuse persisted login state, and should only be run after confirming the destination account and content to avoid unintended publication.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"README.zh.md","start_line":626,"end_line":660}]},{"id":"RA2","finding_id":"finding-8dce0a31ae7046ceb70cdd4cecfe69cf","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Session Persistence","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"README.zh.md","start_line":978,"end_line":null},"finding":"mkdir -p ~/.baoyu-skills\n\n# 创建 .env 文件\ncat > ~/.baoyu-skills/.env << 'EOF'\n# OpenAI\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx\nOPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1.5\n# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1\n\n# OpenRouter\nOPE","explanation":"Skill establishes unauthorized persistence across sessions via cron jobs, startup scripts, or state files. Session persistence allows an attacker to maintain access beyond the current interaction.","remediation":"Remove any persistence mechanisms (cron jobs, startup scripts, state files). Skills should not maintain state across sessions without explicit user consent.","code_snippet":"\n```bash\n# 创建用户级配置目录\nmkdir -p ~/.baoyu-skills\n\n# 创建 .env 文件\ncat > ~/.baoyu-skills/.env << 'EOF'","intent":null,"tags":["Rogue Agent"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"d7284e6c0b4dd16c05273705c595844f9779bb21a7a3dfb66a578889b71ee163","occurrences":[{"file":"README.zh.md","start_line":978,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-0a31d7ca057644e293e3ae45cb2f2e8f","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"External Transmission","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.5,"location":{"file":"README.md","start_line":1104,"end_line":null},"finding":"https://api.star-history.com/","explanation":"Data is being sent to an external URL. This could be legitimate telemetry or data exfiltration. Manual review is recommended.","remediation":"Verify the destination URL is trusted and necessary. Remove or rep