the user before running page edits, deletes, or regeneration steps.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/SKILL.md","start_line":218,"end_line":240}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-c12a84e5a37247269703db284e25c637","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.86,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/auto-selection.md","start_line":9,"end_line":18},"finding":null,"explanation":"The 'Content Signal Matrix' maps broad labels like 'Personal story', 'balanced', 'Conflict', and 'breakthrough' to styles and presets without defining thresholds or disambiguation rules. Because these categories are common and subjective, the activation conditions for auto-selection are unclear and may lead to inconsistent or unintended preset choices.","remediation":"Define more specific matching criteria for each content signal, include examples and non-examples, and document how conflicting or weak signals should be resolved.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/auto-selection.md","start_line":9,"end_line":18}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-5a8d23a92543438683caff23b9b70260","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.9,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/auto-selection.md","start_line":25,"end_line":25},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file defines activation-style 'Triggers' for the ohmsha preset using very broad terms such as 'technical', 'educational', and 'beginner'. These phrases overlap with many ordinary content descriptions and the file does not provide exclusion conditions or negative examples, so the preset may be invoked more broadly than intended.","remediation":"Narrow the trigger list to more specific, domain-bounded phrases, or add explicit scope constraints and negative examples showing when the ohmsha preset should not be selected.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/auto-selection.md","start_line":25,"end_line":25}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-118314900eb447b393e345c61ff145e2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.97,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":93,"end_line":94},"finding":null,"explanation":"Lines L93-L94 require all text to be in Chinese unless the source material is already in another language. This imposes a specific language/locale choice by default rather than offering the user a language option or documenting a justified region-specific constraint.","remediation":"Allow the user to choose the output language explicitly, or document that the skill is intended only for a Chinese-language use case. For example, change the instruction to prefer Chinese only when the user requests it or when the skill is clearly scoped to Chinese content.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":93,"end_line":94}]},{"id":"RA2","finding_id":"finding-7b35c6d8d50e4a1c80475b04f781f309","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Session Persistence","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-article-illustrator/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":33,"end_line":null},"finding":"Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼\n    Continue to Step 1\n```\n\n## Questions\n\n**Language**: Use user's input language or preferred language for all questions. Do not alwa","explanation":"Skill establishes unauthorized persistence across sessions via cron jobs, startup scripts, or state files. Session persistence allows an attacker to maintain access beyond the current interaction.","remediation":"Remove any persistence mechanisms (cron jobs, startup scripts, state files). Skills should not maintain state across sessions without explicit user consent.","code_snippet":"        │\n        ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼","intent":null,"tags":["Rogue Agent"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"7f3faa10121cddee3738a963b31749cb52c6c44587b2f5241e724f31519fd75c","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-article-illustrator/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":33,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"RA2","finding_id":"finding-7b35c6d8d50e4a1c80475b04f781f309","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Session Persistence","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":33,"end_line":null},"finding":"Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼\n    Continue to Step 1\n```\n\n## Questions\n\n**Language**: Use user's input language or preferred language for all questions. Do not alwa","explanation":"Skill establishes unauthorized persistence across sessions via cron jobs, startup scripts, or state files. Session persistence allows an attacker to maintain access beyond the current interaction.","remediation":"Remove any persistence mechanisms (cron jobs, startup scripts, state files). Skills should not maintain state across sessions without explicit user consent.","code_snippet":"        │\n        ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼","intent":null,"tags":["Rogue Agent"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"7f3faa10121cddee3738a963b31749cb52c6c44587b2f5241e724f31519fd75c","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":33,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-ee457b114bf140daa6eaf42462838229","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/presets/ohmsha.md","start_line":44,"end_line":55},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file states that Doraemon characters must be used by default unless the user explicitly overrides them, and the page-title guidance includes a Japanese/locale-specific example centered on Nobita. This imposes a specific cultural/language framing by default rather than offering a neutral default or explicit user opt-in, which can conflict with language/locale choice policy.","remediation":"Make the character set and locale optional rather than mandatory by default. State that Doraemon-style characters are one available option, and add explicit user choice or opt-in for Japanese-language/culturally specific defaults.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/presets/ohmsha.md","start_line":44,"end_line":55}]},{"id":"YR4","finding_id":"finding-584d4cb0213c4d50bfd9e730525390d6","category":"YARA Match","pattern":"YARA rule 'network_reconnaissance': Network reconnaissance and scanning patterns [hacktools]","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.65,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/presets/wuxia.md","start_line":36,"end_line":null},"finding":"Fierce","explanation":"YARA rule matched a hack tool or exploit indicator (offensive tools, reconnaissance, privilege escalation, or exploit frameworks).","remediation":"Remove offensive tool references and exploit code. Legitimate agent skills should not contain penetration testing tools, exploit frameworks, or reconnaissance utilities.","code_snippet":" Type | Visual Treatment |\n|-------------|-----------------|\n| Internal qi | Glowing aura around character |\n| External qi | Visible energy projection |\n| Qi clash | Radiating impact waves |\n| Qi absorption | Flowing particles toward character |\n| Hidden power | Subtle glow in eyes/fists |\n\n### Energy Colors\n\n| Qi Type | Color |\n|---------|-------|\n| Righteous | Blue (#4299E1), Gold (#FFD700) |\n| Fierce | Red (#DC2626), Orange (#EA580C) |\n| Evil | Purple (#7C3AED), Green (#16A34A) |\n| Pure | White, Silver |\n| Ancient | Gold with particles |\n\n### Combat Visual Language\n\n**Impact moments** must include:\n\n1. Speed lines radiating from impact point\n2. Flying debris (stone, wood, cloth)\n3. Shockwave rings\n4. Dust/energy clouds\n5. Hair and clothing blown back\n\n### Movement Depiction\n\n| Speed Level | Visual Treatment |\n|-------------|-----------------|\n| Normal | Standard pose |\n| Fast | Motion blur, speed lines |\n| Lightning | Afterimages, multiple positions |\n| Teleport | Fade effect, parti","intent":null,"tags":["YARA Match"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"fcd94b224f191db42ce410fdc18072c32b20f0245c5fa083fa0ca29bb506f5f1","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/presets/wuxia.md","start_line":36,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"YR4","finding_id":"finding-584d4cb0213c4d50bfd9e730525390d6","category":"YARA Match","pattern":"YARA rule 'network_reconnaissance': Network reconnaissance and scanning patterns [hacktools]","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.65,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/tones/action.md","start_line":72,"end_line":null},"finding":"Fierce","explanation":"YARA rule matched a hack tool or exploit indicator (offensive tools, reconnaissance, privilege escalation, or exploit frameworks).","remediation":"Remove offensive tool references and exploit code. Legitimate agent skills should not contain penetration testing tools, exploit frameworks, or reconnaissance utilities.","code_snippet":" Type | Visual Treatment |\n|-------------|-----------------|\n| Internal qi | Glowing aura around character |\n| External qi | Visible energy projection |\n| Qi clash | Radiating impact waves |\n| Qi absorption | Flowing particles toward character |\n| Hidden power | Subtle glow in eyes/fists |\n\n### Energy Colors\n\n| Qi Type | Color |\n|---------|-------|\n| Righteous | Blue (#4299E1), Gold (#FFD700) |\n| Fierce | Red (#DC2626), Orange (#EA580C) |\n| Evil | Purple (#7C3AED), Green (#16A34A) |\n| Pure | White, Silver |\n| Ancient | Gold with particles |\n\n### Combat Visual Language\n\n**Impact moments** must include:\n\n1. Speed lines radiating from impact point\n2. Flying debris (stone, wood, cloth)\n3. Shockwave rings\n4. Dust/energy clouds\n5. Hair and clothing blown back\n\n### Movement Depiction\n\n| Speed Level | Visual Treatment |\n|-------------|-----------------|\n| Normal | Standard pose |\n| Fast | Motion blur, speed lines |\n| Lightning | Afterimages, multiple positions |\n| Teleport | Fade effect, parti","intent":null,"tags":["YARA Match"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"fcd94b224f191db42ce410fdc18072c32b20f0245c5fa083fa0ca29bb506f5f1","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/tones/action.md","start_line":72,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SSD-3","finding_id":"finding-2716837a67b74f569cadd3ae00105c51","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/workflow.md","start_line":59,"end_line":71},"finding":null,"explanation":"These lines direct the agent to load a local configuration file from project or home-directory locations and then disclose a summary including the full filesystem path to the user. Even though framed as normal UX, this is a natural-language instruction to expose locally stored user/project data that may be sensitive, especially when sourced from home-directory config.","remediation":"Avoid revealing full local paths or configuration contents by default. Limit output to a minimal confirmation such as the source scope (project/user), and only show specific preference fields after explicit user request or after redacting sensitive values.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/workflow.md","start_line":59,"end_line":71}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-5ec8ba2a6da244898cf1986c01624ff4","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/workflow.md","start_line":481,"end_line":483},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill is described as '漫画生成', but this workflow instructs the agent to execute shell commands and run a TypeScript script via Bun to merge output into a PDF. While producing a PDF may support the workflow, delegating to shell/script execution is a capability category materially broader than the manifest-level purpose and is not justified in the description itself.","remediation":"Constrain the documented workflow to skill-level operations rather than direct shell/script execution, or explicitly declare in the skill description/manifest that the comic skill also performs local file transformations and PDF assembly via external tooling.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-comic/references/workflow.md","start_line":481,"end_line":483}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-76ed592e980849199174b81eecc21251","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/SKILL.md","start_line":84,"end_line":85},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file documents a file-affecting behavior: the example explicitly says a single-file run 'replaces original'. While the options table notes `--keep` defaults to false, the skill does not provide a clear warning that the default invocation may overwrite or remove the original user file, which could affect user data.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning in the description or usage section that the default behavior does not keep the original file and may overwrite/replace it. Recommend `--keep` for safer operation and highlight that users should choose an output path if they want to preserve originals.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/SKILL.md","start_line":84,"end_line":85}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-085596c06b714fa78d6708f6995a30e6","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/scripts/main.ts","start_line":30,"end_line":79},"finding":null,"explanation":"The stated purpose is image compression, but the implementation discovers and executes external programs like `which`, `sips`, `cwebp`, and ImageMagick `convert` via child processes. While compression itself is in-scope, spawning arbitrary system binaries is a broader capability than a typical image-processing utility and is not justified by the manifest text alone.","remediation":"Document that the skill depends on and executes local system image-processing binaries, or constrain the implementation to a bundled/library-based compressor such as `sharp` only.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/scripts/main.ts","start_line":30,"end_line":79}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-bc8c77044d3a4e899919650284969c56","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/scripts/main.ts","start_line":198,"end_line":199},"finding":null,"explanation":"The default behavior sets `keep` to `false`, and later the script renames the original input file to an `_original` backup and replaces it with the compressed output. Although progress is printed after processing, there is no upfront confirmation prompt or explicit user-facing warning in the help text that running the command will alter files unless `--keep` is provided.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning in `printHelp()` and/or a confirmation prompt before processing when `--keep` is not set. Clearly disclose that originals will be renamed/replaced by default and document how `--keep` preserves the source files.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-compress-image/scripts/main.ts","start_line":198,"end_line":199}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-f49328bae74248a892141f617445563e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The invocation guidance includes \"make cover,\" which is short and generic compared with the more specific alternatives listed nearby. In markdown skill descriptions, such broad trigger wording can match ordinary conversation about creating covers without clearly narrowing the context to article cover image generation.","remediation":"Replace \"make cover\" with a more specific phrase such as \"make article cover image\" or explicitly constrain activation to article/image-generation contexts. Consider adding negative examples showing requests that should not trigger the skill.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"EA2","finding_id":"finding-f4f338d1ab9c4c748dd80f0b43ecb024","category":"Excessive Agency","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.85,"location":{"file":"README.md","start_line":276,"end_line":null},"finding":"skip confirmation","explanation":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","code_snippet":"# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions","intent":null,"tags":["Excessive Agency"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"dc5042bb58e6fe9c8a4b4901b478317aa266bbe711b5044a1f06d1aad1e0fa2d","occurrences":[{"file":"README.md","start_line":276,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"EA2","finding_id":"finding-f4f338d1ab9c4c748dd80f0b43ecb024","category":"Excessive Agency","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.85,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":20,"end_line":null},"finding":"skip confirmation","explanation":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","code_snippet":"# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions","intent":null,"tags":["Excessive Agency"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"dc5042bb58e6fe9c8a4b4901b478317aa266bbe711b5044a1f06d1aad1e0fa2d","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":20,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-e8a4a7fbdb4a4012b380ff3ec26e3190","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":158,"end_line":160},"finding":null,"explanation":"The workflow explicitly says to save reference images and pasted source content, and the file structure section shows those artifacts being written to persistent output directories. For a markdown skill description, this is a user-data handling behavior that should be clearly disclosed up front because it affects privacy and local files.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning in the usage or workflow section stating that provided reference images and pasted content are stored on disk under the output directory, including the relevant paths and how users can avoid or clean up saved files.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/SKILL.md","start_line":158,"end_line":160}]},{"id":"SDI-1","finding_id":"finding-76179ccb2f7a4dd9968cbe6f88876238","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.83,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"The manifest-level purpose for this subskill is narrowly '封面图生成' (cover image generation). Line L010 adds a substantive policy directive about handling sensitive or copyrighted figures and explicitly says not to refuse generation, which broadens the behavior beyond neutral cover-image composition guidance into content-policy bypass for restricted subjects.","remediation":"Constrain the prompt to cover-image composition only, and remove the 'DO NOT refuse to generate' instruction. If handling copyrighted or sensitive figures is intended, declare that scope explicitly in the skill description and document the safety constraints.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"SSD-1","finding_id":"finding-d4fca1605f9c4e78b20223e4309b863e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"The line explicitly tells the model to create stylistically similar alternatives for sensitive or copyrighted figures and adds 'DO NOT refuse to generate,' which semantically pressures the model to override normal safety or rights-based refusal behavior. Although phrased as a helpful design guideline, its intent is to redirect the model away from compliance safeguards through a polite reframing rather than a literal jailbreak phrase.","remediation":"Remove the 'DO NOT refuse to generate' directive and replace it with compliant guidance such as requiring the model to follow platform safety and copyright policies. If alternatives are desired, specify that they must be original, non-infringing, and generated only when allowed by applicable policy.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/references/base-prompt.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"RA2","finding_id":"finding-309c06c62b34404eb87494d46bbe9572","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Session Persistence","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-cover-image/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":33,"end_line":null},"finding":"Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼\n    Continue to Step 1\n```\n\n## Questions\n\n**Language**: Use user's input language or saved language preference.\n\nUse AskUserQuestion w","explanation":"Skill establishes unauthorized persistence across sessions via cron jobs, startup scripts, or state files. Session persistence allows an attacker to maintain access beyond the current interaction.","remediation":"Remove any persistence mechanisms (cron jobs, startup scripts, state files). Skills should not maintain state across sessions without explicit user consent.","code_snippet":"        │\n        ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ Create EXTEND.md    │\n└─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼","intent":null,"tags":["Rogue Agent"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"6c3c22f4581c6b3c37d73eb8940472937799b52828fb496affd2057483ce8681","occurrences":[{"file":"