 the conversion flow, or explicitly declare browser-session discovery/reuse as part of the skill's scope. Avoid scanning default user data directories and process listings unless that behavior is intentionally documented and justified.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":211,"end_line":317}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-a54a0b69f9664f3bb5c5a218af03c274","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":460,"end_line":487},"finding":null,"explanation":"The code creates profile directories, spawns a Chrome process with remote debugging enabled, and later sends SIGTERM/SIGKILL to stop it. Process management is a powerful local capability that goes beyond the narrow semantic purpose described for the skill, especially since the manifest does not describe controlling local applications.","remediation":"Document local browser process control explicitly if it is intended, or refactor to use a safer, more constrained mechanism provided by the execution environment. Minimize process lifecycle control and ensure any spawned browser is isolated to the skill's own temporary profile.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":460,"end_line":487}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-1d3c9dc45a5045b7b418eaf705a3bc95","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":460,"end_line":473},"finding":null,"explanation":"This function creates a filesystem directory and launches a Chrome subprocess with a persistent user-data directory, but the code provides no confirmation prompt, log message, or explanatory comment/docstring warning the caller about those side effects. For a code-file audit, subprocess execution and file writes are safety-relevant operations that should have some visible disclosure unless clearly documented elsewhere in the skill description, which is not present in this file.","remediation":"Add a user-visible warning or log before creating the profile directory and spawning Chrome, or add a clear docstring/comment stating that the function will create a local Chrome profile directory and launch a browser process. If this behavior is expected as part of the skill, document it explicitly in the skill README/SKILL.md as well.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":460,"end_line":473}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-82f554c42b46420788d1c822ebbb464a","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.84,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":476,"end_line":486},"finding":null,"explanation":"This function first sends SIGTERM and then escalates to SIGKILL, which is a destructive and potentially irreversible operation against a running process. The code includes no prompt, logging, or explanatory comment/docstring to disclose that the skill may forcibly terminate Chrome.","remediation":"Add a clear warning or log message before terminating the process, and document in code comments or skill documentation that the helper may forcibly kill Chrome if graceful shutdown fails. Where appropriate, require explicit caller confirmation before invoking forced termination.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-danger-x-to-markdown/scripts/vendor/baoyu-chrome-cdp/src/index.ts","start_line":476,"end_line":486}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-bbcffce220cd4b39a2027e89c2ca5a8d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The invocation guidance includes generic phrases like \"add formatting\" and \"improve article layout,\" which are broad enough to match many ordinary writing or editing requests outside this specific skill's intended scope. The file does not provide exclusion conditions or tighter constraints to distinguish when this formatter should activate versus when a general writing/editing skill should.","remediation":"Narrow the trigger description to more specific, domain-bound phrases, such as explicit commands involving markdown/plain-text file formatting. Add negative examples or scope limits clarifying that it applies only when the user wants structural markdown formatting and output to a formatted markdown file.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"SDI-1","finding_id":"finding-c767e5c1bb264b1ba509d40fa342abfa","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":16,"end_line":18},"finding":null,"explanation":"The overview says the goal is to transform text into reader-friendly markdown 'without changing any original content' and the core principle says to only adjust formatting and fix obvious typos. However, later steps require creating an analysis file, generating or replacing title candidates, adding YAML frontmatter fields like slug/summary/description, and potentially removing an H1 from the body, which goes beyond pure formatting.","remediation":"Narrow the description to explicitly include metadata generation and content analysis, or remove those behaviors from the workflow. If the skill is intended to be formatting-only, avoid generating titles, summaries, descriptions, slugs, and separate analysis files.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":16,"end_line":18}]},{"id":"SDI-4","finding_id":"finding-116eac67f9fe4f3f854ea87c801314b4","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":18,"end_line":18},"finding":null,"explanation":"The line states 'Never add, delete, or rewrite content,' but later instructions direct the skill to create missing frontmatter, generate summary/description text, infer or generate slugs, add headings, convert prose into lists or tables, and remove an H1 from the body after extracting it to frontmatter. Those are active additions/deletions to the document, not merely neutral typography fixes.","remediation":"Revise the principle to accurately reflect permitted modifications, such as allowing structural edits and metadata generation. Alternatively, constrain the workflow so it only performs non-substantive formatting and typo correction.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":18,"end_line":18}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-4252d36624254f54a5901c359eff6746","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":145,"end_line":145},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill instructs saving an analysis file, and later saving a formatted output and backing up existing files, which are file-write operations that affect the user's workspace. While some steps mention outputs and backups, the markdown skill description does not provide a clear upfront warning that the workflow will create additional files and may rename existing formatted outputs.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning near the description or usage section stating that the skill creates `{original-filename}-analysis.md`, writes `{original-filename}-formatted.md`, and may rename an existing formatted file to a timestamped backup before proceeding.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/SKILL.md","start_line":145,"end_line":145}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-40cf2af04caa4e88b6e0f8002a23067d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/scripts/autocorrect.ts","start_line":4,"end_line":8},"finding":null,"explanation":"This file belongs to the Markdown formatting skill, whose stated purpose is formatting Markdown. Instead of performing formatting internally, it spawns an external `npx autocorrect-node --fix` process, which is a broader capability than simple text formatting and is not obviously justified from the manifest description alone.","remediation":"Document that the skill depends on executing the external `autocorrect-node` formatter, or constrain the implementation to an internal/library-based formatter. If subprocess execution is intended, explicitly declare this capability in the skill documentation/manifest.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-format-markdown/scripts/autocorrect.ts","start_line":4,"end_line":8}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-e6b8185430274cd38cce138fb92fe5ac","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The description says to use the skill when the user asks to \"generate, create, or draw images.\" Terms like \"create\" and \"draw images\" are broad natural-language phrases that can overlap with ordinary conversation, and the file does not provide exclusion conditions or narrower trigger constraints.","remediation":"Narrow the activation guidance to more specific trigger phrases or contexts, such as explicit requests for AI image generation, and add negative examples or scope limits to reduce accidental invocation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-61fe156023cb468c9c59ad374b93de52","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.97,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/SKILL.md","start_line":16,"end_line":16},"finding":null,"explanation":"The markdown clearly states that the skill uses multiple external provider APIs and supports prompt files and reference images, which implies user content may be transmitted off-system. However, the description does not include an explicit warning about sharing prompts/images with third-party services or any privacy/data-handling caution.","remediation":"Add a prominent warning in the skill description that prompts, prompt-file contents, and reference images may be transmitted to external providers, and advise users not to include sensitive or confidential content unless they consent.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/SKILL.md","start_line":16,"end_line":16}]},{"id":"RA2","finding_id":"finding-b87659a9e3044b79a0326e6438754190","category":"Rogue Agent","pattern":"Session Persistence","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":27,"end_line":null},"finding":"Create EXTEND.md    │    │ Update EXTEND.md     │\n└─────────────────────┘    └───────────