rity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/scripts/providers/seedream.ts","start_line":321,"end_line":328},"finding":null,"explanation":"This fetch call posts the prompt and optional image data to a third-party endpoint authenticated by ARK_API_KEY. Although there is a console message about calling the API, it does not clearly warn that user content is being transmitted off-system to an external service, which is the type of disclosure SQP-2 expects for network operations involving user data.","remediation":"Add a user-visible warning in the CLI output, docstring, or README explaining that prompts and any reference images are sent to the Seedream/Volcengine service. If possible, emit a more explicit runtime notice before the POST request is made.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-image-gen/scripts/providers/seedream.ts","start_line":321,"end_line":328}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-d55841f8c40b48f7816be6beb8e6c61f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-infographic/SKILL.md","start_line":121,"end_line":132},"finding":null,"explanation":"The markdown describes the output structure and later workflow steps that save files and rename existing files as backups, but it does not explicitly warn users that invoking the skill will create multiple files and modify pre-existing outputs. Because these are data-affecting filesystem operations, the skill description should disclose them clearly to users.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning in the markdown usage or output section stating that the skill creates an `infographic/{topic-slug}/` directory, writes multiple intermediate/output files, and renames existing files to timestamped backups when conflicts occur.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-infographic/SKILL.md","start_line":121,"end_line":132}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-e2e038ccd62442fd8c9d92d27178e7e7","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-infographic/SKILL.md","start_line":183,"end_line":191},"finding":null,"explanation":"The workflow instructs the agent to rename existing `source.md` and `analysis.md` files to timestamped backups, and similar overwrite-avoidance behavior appears later for prompt and image outputs. Although operationally reasonable, this is still a modification to user files and is not presented as a clear warning to the user in the skill description.","remediation":"Add a visible note near Usage or Workflow explaining that if output files already exist, the skill will automatically rename them to `*-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.*` before writing new outputs.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-infographic/SKILL.md","start_line":183,"end_line":191}]},{"id":"EA2","finding_id":"finding-5073a4fb99234b3c93b07f599e400071","category":"Excessive Agency","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/SKILL.md","start_line":106,"end_line":null},"finding":"do NOT ask the user","explanation":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","code_snippet":"if (Test-Path \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/EXTEND.md\") { Select-String -Pattern 'default_theme:.*' -Path \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/EXTEND.md\" | ForEach-Object { $_.Matches.Value } }\n```\n\n**If theme is resolved from EXTEND.md**: Use it directly, do NOT ask the user.\n\n**If no default found**: Use AskUserQuestion to confirm:\n","intent":null,"tags":["Excessive Agency"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"1217faffadbcbad893861efe39d855dd3a75bdf1b522e38023f7deec4953005a","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/SKILL.md","start_line":106,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-1f5e38687a2e46a09f4b0ea295108c90","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/SKILL.md","start_line":199,"end_line":205},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file states that the tool writes an HTML file in the same directory as the input and may also create timestamped backup files if a target file already exists. Because these are user-data-affecting filesystem changes, the skill description should visibly warn users that conversion modifies files on disk and may create backups.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning in the skill description that running the converter creates or overwrites output files in the input directory and may generate backup files for existing HTML outputs.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/SKILL.md","start_line":199,"end_line":205}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-402437e58e1f40ffbe49db778cca74af","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":142,"end_line":145},"finding":null,"explanation":"This code generates a URL against a remote PlantUML server using the user-provided diagram source encoded into the request path. Although the code comments describe URL generation, there is no user-facing disclosure, prompt, or warning that diagram contents will be transmitted off-system to an external service.","remediation":"Add an explicit user-facing warning in code or accompanying markdown that PlantUML content is sent to the configured serverUrl, and consider requiring opt-in or confirmation before using the default public server.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":142,"end_line":145}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-46f73d2de5fe4cb89c5e018f3c923db7","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.87,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":161,"end_line":209},"finding":null,"explanation":"This file belongs to the markdown-to-html skill, whose stated purpose is converting Markdown to HTML. While generating an external image URL for PlantUML is related to rendering, enabling `inlineSvg` causes the code to actively fetch remote content from a PlantUML server and inject the returned SVG into the output DOM, which is a broader networked capability than simple format conversion.","remediation":"Keep PlantUML rendering in a non-fetching mode by default, emitting only image URLs or static placeholders during conversion. If inline remote fetching is required, document that the skill performs network access to third-party PlantUML servers and gate it behind an explicit opt-in configuration.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":161,"end_line":209}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-35bf028c819c4f29985e667958635117","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.9,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":167,"end_line":167},"finding":null,"explanation":"When inlineSvg is enabled, the code fetches SVG content from the remote PlantUML server. This network transmission may expose user-authored diagram data or metadata, but the implementation provides no user-facing disclosure beyond internal comments and console warnings.","remediation":"Document this remote fetch behavior in a visible warning, and consider surfacing a runtime notice or requiring explicit opt-in before fetching from external PlantUML services.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":167,"end_line":167}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-b4f4ea105e6c460c9e6a44540c7d661f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.97,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":51,"end_line":66},"finding":null,"explanation":"The generated HTML forces a specific Chinese font family (`微软雅黑`) and includes fixed Chinese instructional text (`<<< 左右滑动看更多 >>>`). This is a natural-language locale policy issue because the skill output is constrained to a specific language/locale with no user choice or opt-in visible in this file.","remediation":"Make the instructional text configurable based on user preference or locale, and avoid forcing a locale-specific font unless clearly documented as a justified region-specific requirement.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":51,"end_line":66}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-f6d06a1392a24ef981d48c9edb50706a","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172},"finding":null,"explanation":"The reading-time block always renders Chinese text (\"字数…阅读大约需…分钟\") regardless of user preference or environment. This is a natural-language locale policy concern because the skill forces a specific language in output without any opt-in or documented regional constraint.","remediation":"Externalize user-facing strings and make the reading-time message configurable by locale, or provide a user/caller option to select language. If the skill is intentionally China/Chinese-specific, document that constraint clearly in the skill description or configuration.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-82c4fcfbb12d4c14a7d00e235eec65cd","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":278,"end_line":282},"finding":null,"explanation":"This skill is described as a Markdown-to-HTML converter, but the renderer directly interpolates unescaped href, title, and alt text into <img> HTML and also emits raw HTML in preprocessCjkEmphasis via node.type = \"html\" (L389-L396). That goes beyond a purely formatting/conversion role by preserving or constructing active HTML content without evident sanitization, which is not clearly justified by the stated purpose alone.","remediation":"Escape or sanitize user-controlled attribute values before embedding them in HTML, and avoid creating raw HTML AST nodes from markdown text unless a sanitizer is applied after rendering. If raw HTML support is intentional, document that behavior explicitly and run the final output through an allowlist-based HTML sanitizer.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":278,"end_line":282}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-e3a32b3944bc4866a0e02796e156598d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":331,"end_line":336},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file instructs the agent to prompt for `WECHAT_APP_ID` and `WECHAT_APP_SECRET` and then write them into project- or user-level `.env` files. Because this operation handles sensitive credentials and persists them to disk, the skill should explicitly warn the user about secret storage implications and recommend protecting or excluding these files from version control.","remediation":"Add a clear warning near the credential setup steps stating that AppID/AppSecret are sensitive, will be saved locally to a `.env` file, should not be committed to source control, and should be stored with appropriate file protections.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":331,"end_line":336}]},{"id":"EA2","finding_id":"finding-dcd4cd68091147a091bafaa0975c7d20","category":"Excessive Agency","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":340,"end_line":null},"finding":"do NOT ask user","explanation":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","code_snippet":"\n### Step 3: Resolve Theme/Color and Validate Metadata\n\n1. **Resolve theme** (first match wins, do NOT ask user if resolved):\n   - CLI `--theme` argument\n   - EXTEND.md `default_theme` (loaded in Step 0)\n   - Fallback: `default`","intent":null,"tags":["Excessive Agency"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"97ca5f1442cb4e39e345e08ea6b8ba2be5ca8ece16a7a1eb97f574af1cf623fb","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":340,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-12076f7d112249faaa9a33b496d23340","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":148,"end_line":182},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file instructs the skill to create and write EXTEND.md, and the template later includes `app_id` and `app_secret` fields. While it confirms the save path, it does not warn users that credentials may be stored in plaintext in project- or user-scoped files, which is a privacy and security-relevant behavior.","remediation":"Add a clear warning in the setup instructions that EXTEND.md may contain sensitive credentials, specify that it is stored locally in plaintext unless otherwise protected, and advise users to choose the storage location carefully and avoid committing the file to version control.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":148,"end_line":182}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-975b01ab14e24cbd8d50e1de5a8b3ed9","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.87,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":181,"end_line":182},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file describes itself as a first-time setup flow for preferences, but the provided EXTEND.md template also includes `app_id` and `app_secret`, which are credentials rather than simple presentation or publishing preferences. Storing service credentials is a more sensitive capability that is not justified by the narrow 'preferences setup' framing of this document.","remediation":"Either update the setup description to explicitly state that credential configuration is part of the flow, or remove credential fields from this preferences setup template and handle secrets in a separate, clearly labeled credential-setup process.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/references/config/first-time-setup.md","start_line":181,"end_line":182}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-1625d262d5e243f48af4c66c3c23e014","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.82,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/cdp.ts","start_line":231,"end_line":246},"finding":null,"explanation":"This function simulates a paste action into the browser, which can transfer potentially sensitive clipboard contents into a web page. In this file there is no confirmation prompt, warning comment, or user-facing disclosure around that action.","remediation":"Add a visible warning or confirmation before triggering clipboard paste, or document clearly in code comments/associated markdown that the skill may read from the user's clipboard and paste its contents into the active page.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/cdp.ts","start_line":231,"end_line":246}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-48fed39955bd4730b7d8ac3c620d1494","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.87,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts","start_line":1,"end_line":154},"finding":null,"explanation":"This helper is part of a skill whose stated purpose is posting content to WeChat, but the implementation achieves that by spawning platform-specific automation tools such as osascript, xdotool, ydotool, and PowerShell SendKeys to control the frontmost application. Driving arbitrary GUI applications via synthetic paste keystrokes is a broader capability than the manifest description suggests and is not obviously limited to WeChat-specific posting.","remediation":"Document this GUI automation capability explicitly in the skill description or narrow the implementation so it targets only the intended WeChat posting workflow. If generic desktop automation is required, separate it into a clearly scoped helper skill or add constraints that restrict allowed target applications and usage contexts.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts","start_line":1,"end_line":154}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-6f7c27e5b2c34e78a87818d22ffea409","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/document.ts","start_line":194,"end_line":199},"finding":null,"explanation":"This function silently renames an existing output HTML file to a backup and then writes a new file to the same location. There is no confirmation prompt, log message, or inline warning indicating that user files will be modified on disk, which is a safety-relevant side effect for a code file.","remediation":"Add a visible disclosure before modifying files, such as a confirmation step, a returned warning status, or at minimum a log/message documenting that an existing .html file will be renamed to a backup and replaced. Consider making overwrite behavior opt-in via an explicit option.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/document.ts","start_line":194,"end_line":199}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-af1280a035374411a8d73c937b9fef36","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":142,"end_line":145},"finding":null,"explanation":"This code generates a URL against a remote PlantUML server using the diagram source encoded into the request path, which transmits user-authored content off-system. Although the implementation comments describe the server URL, there is no user-facing disclosure, confirmation, or warning in this file about external transmission of diagram data.","remediation":"Add a clear user-facing warning or documentation comment that PlantUML source will be sent to the configured remote server, or require explicit opt-in/confirmation before using a non-local server. If possible, support a local/self-hosted PlantUML server as the default for privacy-sensitive use cases.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":142,"end_line":145}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-bb62285df2d04b49b77ee74ba93637f5","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.9,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":191,"end_line":198},"finding":null,"explanation":"The fetch call retrieves SVG content from the configured PlantUML server, causing network access and transmission of diagram-derived data. This file contains technical comments and warning logs for failures, but no user disclosure that enabling this feature performs remote requests.","remediation":"Document and surface a user-visible warning that inline SVG rendering performs remote network requests to the PlantUML server. Consider adding an explicit option name or confirmation flow that makes the remote fetch behavior obvious before use.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/plantuml.ts","start_line":191,"end_line":198}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-5a54223d7f484c2dab5e87b18a53e91f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":51,"end_line":66},"finding":null,"explanation":"The renderer injects Chinese-specific presentation and messaging, including the font family \"微软雅黑\" and the instruction text \"<<< 左右滑动看更多 >>>\", without any user opt-in or locale selection. This can force a specific language/locale experience for all users, which matches the policy-violation category for language or locale constraints.","remediation":"Make the instructional text and locale-specific styling configurable based on user preference or detected locale, or document that this skill is explicitly region/language-specific. If Chinese-only behavior is intentional, clearly justify and scope it in the skill documentation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":51,"end_line":66}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-eb71b9cfb11f4b708bd2c5233ce71862","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":57,"end_line":59},"finding":null,"explanation":"This extension is documented as adding support for horizontal sliding images in Markdown, but its renderer directly interpolates parsed alt text and src values into raw HTML attributes and element content without escaping. For a Markdown/HTML formatting helper embedded in a posting skill, generating unsanitized HTML from input content is a capability that is not obviously required by the stated purpose and can enable unintended markup injection into downstream rendered output.","remediation":"HTML-escape alt text before placing it into attributes or paragraph content, and validate or sanitize image URLs before inserting them into src attributes. Prefer using a safe HTML builder or the parent Markdown renderer's escaping utilities rather than manual string interpolation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/slider.ts","start_line":57,"end_line":59}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-1f71e6fdfb9e4f058741c5704509a79a","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172},"finding":null,"explanation":"This code injects a user-facing string in Chinese for all rendered content: \"字数 ... 阅读大约需 ... 分钟\". That imposes a specific language/locale in the output without any user opt-in or visible justification that the renderer is intentionally China/Chinese-specific.","remediation":"Make the reading-time label configurable by locale, or default to a neutral language only when explicitly requested. If the skill is intended only for a Chinese-language WeChat publishing workflow, document that scope clearly and gate the locale behavior through configuration.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-49424d225dd947f29fa859c20a106bbc","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/wechat-agent-browser.ts","start_line":110,"end_line":123},"finding":null,"explanation":"This code automates posting a title, content, and image files to an external service, which is a network/data-transmission operation. Although the script logs operational steps, it does not clearly disclose to the user that supplied text and local files will be uploaded to WeChat, nor does it provide a confirmation prompt before doing so.","remediation":"Add a clear user-facing warning in the CLI help, module header comment, or runtime output stating that the script uploads provided content and image files to WeChat's servers. Optionally require an explicit confirmation flag before opening the site and uploading data.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/wechat-agent-browser.ts","start_line":110,"end_line":123}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-25791ed643804eeda85a8c43dc341355","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"External Transmission","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.5,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":387,"end_line":null},"finding":"https://api.weixin.qq.com/","explanation":"Data is being sent to an external URL. This could be legitimate telemetry or data exfiltration. Manual review is recommended.","remediation":"Verify the destination URL is trusted and necessary. Remove or replace with documented APIs. Ensure no secrets, tokens, or PII are transmitted.","code_snippet":"  onlyFansCanComment?: number;\n}\n\nconst TOKEN_URL = \"https://api.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/token\";\nconst UPLOAD_URL = \"https://api.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/material/add_material\";\nconst DRAFT_URL = \"https://api.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/draft/add\";\n","intent":null,"tags":["Data Exfiltration"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"5051592be94bbaa0d4f86802ff5c7e420e2bd06b940b22d4b37ef740b9dbb868","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/SKILL.md","start_line":387,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-25791ed643804eeda85a8c43dc341355","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"Exter