egion/language specific.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/infographic.ts","start_line":109,"end_line":109}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-be66aaedf0e4442aa390124ab7ecba64","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.82,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/ruby.ts","start_line":4,"end_line":17},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file's natural-language comments and usage documentation are entirely in Chinese, with no indication that the skill is region-specific or that users may choose another language. Under the policy rule for language/locale constraints, this can be treated as a forced language choice lacking opt-in or justification.","remediation":"Document that the skill is intentionally Chinese-language or region-specific, or provide bilingual/user-selectable documentation and comments where user-facing maintenance instructions are expected.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/extensions/ruby.ts","start_line":4,"end_line":17}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-da508f1ebb34440bbfbe0a615ba140e0","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172},"finding":null,"explanation":"The reading-time banner always renders Chinese text (\"字数…阅读大约需…分钟\") regardless of user preference or environment. This is a natural-language locale constraint in the code and there is no visible opt-in, fallback, or configuration here to let users choose another language.","remediation":"Externalize user-facing strings and add a locale option or inherit the user's language setting. If the skill is intentionally Chinese-only, document that constraint clearly in user-facing documentation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/renderer.ts","start_line":172,"end_line":172}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-b6a8bd498ca3459f963389a3ed989077","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/utils/languages.ts","start_line":112,"end_line":112},"finding":null,"explanation":"This TypeScript code file performs a remote fetch-like operation via dynamic import from an external CDN, which can transmit user/system context such as IP address and request metadata. There is no confirmation prompt or user-facing disclosure near the operation; only an error warning is logged on failure.","remediation":"Add a clear comment or user-facing disclosure indicating that missing language grammars are loaded from a remote CDN at runtime, or provide a configuration option to disable remote loading and require explicit user opt-in.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-weibo/scripts/vendor/baoyu-md/src/utils/languages.ts","start_line":112,"end_line":112}]},{"id":"SDI-4","finding_id":"finding-e114b672f8e54d1db9a9ee3953a33289","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.82,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/SKILL.md","start_line":213,"end_line":219},"finding":null,"explanation":"Lines L218-L219 describe the skill as only filling content into the browser for the user to review and publish manually, implying a limited, non-invasive workflow. But L213 instructs the agent to automatically kill existing Chrome debugging instances and retry, which is an additional side effect on the local system that contradicts the claimed limited behavior.","remediation":"Revise the notes to accurately disclose that the skill may terminate existing Chrome CDP sessions during recovery, or remove that automatic behavior so the implementation matches the stated manual-review-only model.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/SKILL.md","start_line":213,"end_line":219}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-f638dba761d548f190be19b9d9e010ce","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.9,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/references/articles.md","start_line":69,"end_line":69},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file describes that remote images are 'automatically downloaded to temp directory' but does not present it as a user-facing warning or disclosure. Because the skill handles external content and writes files locally, the behavior should be explicitly called out as something that may affect local storage and privacy expectations.","remediation":"Add a short warning in the usage or image-handling section stating that remote image URLs in the markdown will be fetched and saved locally in a temporary directory during processing.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/references/articles.md","start_line":69,"end_line":69}]},{"id":"SDI-1","finding_id":"finding-c97e3baacddb4977a2766fc08c724c35","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.86,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/scripts/md-to-html.ts","start_line":118,"end_line":148},"finding":null,"explanation":"The script not only parses Markdown and emits HTML/JSON, but also creates temporary files for downloaded images and optionally writes the generated HTML to an arbitrary output path. Persistent filesystem writes are additional operational behavior beyond a narrow 'Markdown to HTML' description.","remediation":"Document the temp-file caching and output-file writing behavior in the skill description/help text, or separate file-writing features into an explicitly named export or CLI mode.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/scripts/md-to-html.ts","start_line":118,"end_line":148}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-966c56b161ac46d9af2572136c1b7cde","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.76,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/scripts/md-to-html.ts","start_line":447,"end_line":449},"finding":null,"explanation":"The script writes generated HTML to a user-provided path, which can modify filesystem state, but there is no confirmation prompt or warning about this side effect beyond listing the option in usage text. For a tool that otherwise converts and prints content, saving to disk is a notable file-write action that should be disclosed more explicitly.","remediation":"Document clearly in the help text and/or code comments that --save-html writes to the specified filesystem path and may overwrite existing content. Optionally add an existence check with a confirmation or a separate --force flag before overwriting files.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-x/scripts/md-to-html.ts","start_line":447,"end_line":449}]},{"id":"SC1","finding_id":"finding-7b76579383e34d23af92d5b9588132f9","category":"Supply Chain","pattern":"Unpinned Dependencies","severity":"LOW","confidence":0.4,"location":{"file":"packages/baoyu-md/package.json","start_line":11,"end_line":null},"finding":"\"front-matter\": \"^4.0.2\"","explanation":"Dependencies lack version pinning, allowing potential malicious package updates. Consider pinning versions.","remediation":"Pin all dependency versions in requirements.txt or pyproject.toml. Use exact versions (==) or compatible ranges. Run pip-audit regularly.","code_snippet":"  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"dependencies\"