d locale, or add an explicit opt-in/defaulting policy. If the skill is intentionally optimized for English and Chinese only, state that limitation and justify it clearly.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-slide-deck/references/design-guidelines.md","start_line":125,"end_line":149}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-6f3d5a962f944081b4530fc46774c9f2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.82,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-slide-deck/references/outline-template.md","start_line":14,"end_line":14},"finding":null,"explanation":"The template requires a `Language: [output language]` field but does not state that the language should be selected by the user or default to the user's preference. This can encourage skills using the template to force a language/locale choice without explicit opt-in, which is a natural-language policy concern.","remediation":"Add guidance that the output language must be user-selected or derived from the user's current preference, and avoid forcing a language unless the skill is explicitly region- or locale-specific.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-slide-deck/references/outline-template.md","start_line":14,"end_line":14}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-efbb538dc80846c89a7a6be6f61c32b1","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-translate/references/refined-workflow.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"The markdown explicitly states that all intermediate results are saved as files in the output directory, and later steps repeatedly instruct saving multiple artifacts. However, the document does not warn users that source-derived content and analyses will be persisted on disk or may overwrite existing files, which is a relevant disclosure for user data handling.","remediation":"Add a brief warning near the workflow overview explaining that the skill writes multiple intermediate and final files to the output directory, may overwrite same-named files, and should be used only with an output path the user expects to modify.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-translate/references/refined-workflow.md","start_line":10,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"SC4","finding_id":"finding-0fac0b5aab6c4c559c976d62d6ad1b15","category":"Supply Chain","pattern":"🟡 SC4: OSV.dev unreachable, using static fallback (9 packages). Results may be incomplete. Set SKILLSPECTOR_OSV_TIMEOUT to increase timeout or check network connectivity to api.osv.dev.","severity":"LOW","confidence":1,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/package.json","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":"SC4 fallback active","explanation":"Dependency has known vulnerabilities (CVEs). Using packages with unpatched security flaws exposes the environment to known exploits.","remediation":"Update the dependency to a patched version that addresses the known CVE. Check OSV (osv.dev) or NVD for details on the vulnerability.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["Supply Chain"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"d72d6321240ae9d21e301fd977b7166e9da0b11fff924f75c5308492aaf1a953","occurrences":[{"file":"skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/scripts/package.json","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SC4","finding_id":"finding-0fac0b5aab6c4c559c976d62d6ad1b15","category":"Supply Chain","pattern":"🟡 SC4: OSV.dev unreachable, using static fallback (9 packages). Results may be incomplete. Set SKILLSPECTOR_OSV_TIMEOUT to increase timeout or check network connectivity to api.osv.dev.","severity":"LOW","confidence":1,"location":{"file":"skills/baoyu-post-to-wechat/scripts/package.json","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":"SC4 fallback active","explanation":"Dependency has known vulnerabilities (